I try to make sure I'm carrying a random tin round with me. Especially at 
lower levels this can be useful as you can pacify any hostile domestic 
animals, and it is re-usable. This avoids the ever-so-embarrassing 'killed 
by a kitten'.

If you can stop any current pets killing them then you also have a ready 
supply of replacement pets any time you need one: for example, if I reach 
the top of Sokoban without a pet I'll usually go back and tame something 
before hitting the zoo.

